!
! How long a clip lasts, in milliseconds, in Trebago: each count of
! samples of one channel (frames) at a sample rate in hertz is
! samples * 1000 / rate, an exact reduced rational (441 samples at 44100 Hz
! is 10 ms; 1 sample at 44100 Hz is 10/441 ms), never rounded. A rate of 0
! is a division by zero, refused.
trebago clipms
  in  samples(n), rate
  out ms(n)
  ms(i) = samples(i) * 1000 / rate
end
